{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When Volleyball Meets Firepower!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock and load, it's time to bump, set, and unleash chaos in the most explosive twist on volleyball yet! <strong>Volley Guns</strong> is a chaotic, cartoon-styled multiplayer party game where classic volleyball rules get a full-throttle makeover\u2026by adding <strong>guns!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the colorful world of <strong>Block City</strong>, you'll step into the sneakers of outrageous characters armed to the teeth with zany weapons and unforgettable style. Forget everything you know about volleyball\u2014this game rewrites the rulebook with style and firepower. Want to blast the ball mid-flight? Deflect a spike with a parry? Use Jumpads to dominate the skies? Go for it. In Block City, it\u2019s not just about scoring points, it\u2019s about doing it with flair!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras/fd07d2bd801c049f39cc9e0d30b05bd2.avif?t=1761761449\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 player (2v2) multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple unique game modes\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 characters\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 weapon types\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Maps\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952510?t=1761761449","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952510?t=1761761449","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/b8c34f0199a65b709e489c4f4e17b5d0837ab520/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761761449","capsule_ima